  "failed_actions": [],
  "conflicts": [
    "Contractor: Keystone Compliance (events 013-014, 018) vs Riverside Works / Isaac Palmer (event 016). Trusted neither yet; escalated.",
    "Visit date: 30/08/2025 10:00 (event 017, 019) is a Saturday; the contractor offered Monday 10-12 (event 016), which is 01/09/2025. Monday was not confirmed by the contractor.",
    "Tenant name: Clara (events 018 and the 'Tenant Name' field), Ruben Oakley (events 013, 014, 019), Grace Mercer (event 016).",
    "Tenant phone: 07700 900721 (event 014) vs 07700 900077 (event 018, described as a call code). Not used for any outbound contact."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Today is 2025-08-26 as stated in the case.",
    "The tenant's existing email thread (event 015) is the correct channel, since no verified address is on file.",
    "The electric oven fault is routine, not an emergency, as the case classified it."
